files.browser-use/references/signin-rules.json:
{
 "format": 1,
 "about": "Site sign-in rules the host runs as data (Gurum SignInAgent + SigninRules). Each rule: the sites it covers, a one-line note for the sign-in head, the ways to offer (only these), each way's session page ({return} = the address to come back to once signed in) and the words of the control that starts it on that page. A way with requires_app is offered only when that app is on the phone. desktop_sites: sites opened as the desktop site (what Chrome's \"Desktop site\" menu does) because their mobile web stops the sign-in with an app-only notice.",
 "desktop_sites": [
  "gov.kr"
 ],
 "chrome_sites": [
  "*"
 ],
 "webview_sites": [
  "naver.com"
 ],
 "rules": [
  {
   "id": "google",
   "sites": [
    "google.com"
   ],
   "note": "Google (accounts.google.com -- Google's own sign-in and \"Sign in with Google\" on other sites): this browser opens it as the phone's Chrome. Type the user's Google e-mail (\"login\"), never the Google password: on the password step press \"Try another way\" / \"다른 방법 시도\" and choose the passkey or the prompt on the user's phone (\"Tap Yes on your phone or tablet\" / \"휴대전화나 태블릿에서 '예' 탭하기\", a Google prompt), then ask \"person\" (passkey) or \"phone\" (the prompt; put the number Google shows in \"show\"). When the account chooser lists the user's account, press it. Once signed in, go back to the original sign-in."
  },
  {
   "id": "naver",
   "sites": [
    "naver.com"
   ],
   "note": "NAVER (naver.com and every NAVER service, and \"Sign in with NAVER\" on other sites): in this in-app browser the ID and password and the passkey do not work -- never type them and never list them as ways. Sign in with the NAVER app when it is on this phone (its \"앱 열기\" / \"Open app\" control) -- the QR code is for scanning with another device: NAVER refuses a QR code approved in the NAVER app on this same phone (\"QR로그인 실패\", measured 2026-11-15). Once signed in, go back to the original sign-in.",
   "return_param": "url",
   "ways": [
    {
     "id": "qr",
     "kind": "qr",
     "name": {
      "ko": "QR 코드(다른 기기로 찍기)",
      "en": "a QR code (scan it with another device)"
     },
     "page": "https://nid.naver.com/nidlogin.login?mode=form&url={return}",
     "press": [
      "QR 코드 로그인",
      "QR sign-in"
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "app",
     "kind": "app",
     "name": {
      "ko": "네이버 앱",
      "en": "the NAVER app"
     },
     "page": "https://nid.naver.com/nidlogin.login?mode=form&svctype=262144&url={return}",
     "press": [
      "앱 열기",
      "Open app"
     ],
     "requires_app": "com.nhn.android.search"
    }
   ]
  }
 ]
}
